    "title": "The pursuit of excellence",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Dr Rafat Jan has received the Distinguished Alumna of the Year 2016 award from the MUSC College of Nursing Alumni Association.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "7cf7de7433185ecd",
